msgstr ""
"Set books to 'Open Transfer' for ongoing circulation or 'Return After "
"Reading' to ensure they come back."

msgid "信用評價機制"
msgstr "Trust & Rating System"

msgid "面交後雙方互評誠信、準時與書況，累積社群信用，確保每一次借閱都令人安心。"
msgstr ""
"Rate each other on trust, punctuality, and book condition to build community"
" credit for worry-free borrowing."

msgid "運作機制"
msgstr "How It Works"

