msgstr ""
"Meet at the agreed time and place. Confirm book condition, then tap 'Met Up'"
" on the platform."

msgid "雙向評價"
msgstr "Two-Way Rating"

msgid "針對此次交易的友善度、準時度與書況準確度給予評價，共同維護高品質的共享環境。"
msgstr ""
"Rate friendliness, punctuality, and condition accuracy to maintain a high-"
"quality sharing environment."

